{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"evt_6e5815d5-aa7c-4791-95cb-934eb32446af","event_type":"review_disposition","recorded_at":"2026-07-26T19:36:24.445Z","operator_workflow":"skill-evolution","target":{"name":"tdd","repo_relative_path":".claude/skills/tdd","content_hash":"f477e3d312f6f3234b4c5ef44b175584a1b61bbd8651142d3c88473adc2ad5cb","repo_head":"fb1415bc7af83e6c550db9aa49b0f12f470b3b8f"},"top_level_session_id":"88645f76-5caf-4f48-b519-e20e1d38b878","payload":{"review_id":"rev_c08a5b3e-c82c-42b6-8958-8c636dba5e3c","disposition":"resolved_by_change","adjudicated_event_ids":["evt_b70c9daa-6f04-4c8f-80ea-706adf4ef85c","evt_8045b842-88a8-4694-968b-41ebc9ed6387","evt_59fefaa9-90b4-4ece-bd86-e33232687000"],"note":"Mechanism: four TDD closeout validator acceptance predicates gated on brittle literal token sequences and whole-field keyword scans instead of the requirement they enforce, so conforming evidence was rejected, and three messages named no accepted form or the wrong one. (1) validateAuthorityDispositionValue scanned the whole field for conflict/blocked/unresolved before any disposition branch, rejecting resolved 'aligned because ...' and 'N/A because ...' values that merely name this repo's blocker/conflict nouns; now it matches the unresolved state and falls through to the resolved branches. (2) The acceptance atom and sequence maps required the literal bigram 'all rows'; now any universal quantifier (all/every/each, with intervening words) qualifies while some/most/unquantified still fail. (3) The evidence-identity and review-fix-map placeholder scans matched TODO/TBD/pending/unknown and angle tokens inside legitimate backticked or quoted citations; now citations are exempt via unresolvedEvidenceToken and the error names the offending token. (4) The coverage-only red-cell form required a contiguous literal phrase and, on failure, emitted the unrelated expectation-rewrite message; now connective wording is admissible and the message names the coverage-only form. Result: frozen 30-case verdict matrix flipped all 10 defect cases reject->accept with zero change to 10 safety and 10 preserved-pass verdicts; sibling-tree suite identical (one pre-existing docs/robustness-testing.md baseline failure both sides) with 8 added passing regression tests; blind T2 0 rounds vs 2 rounds where the current-side executor was forced into validator source and independently found the same 'pending' collision; every current-authored blind body still passes on the landed version; T5 unresolved-conflict/undetermined-identity body refused on both versions; npm run lint passed after landing. Landed ffcebc98 -> f477e3d3. Left unrepaired as future evidence: the authority check still treats a past-tense 'open question' narrative as unresolved (cost both T1 sides one round)."}}
